# Tech Stack (HARD REQUIREMENTS)
- **Framework:** Next.js 15 (App Router)
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS + Shadcn UI (Use existing components in /components/ui)
- **Icons:** Lucide React
- **Backend:** Convex (Do NOT use Supabase/Firebase)
- **AI/Voice:** Anthropic API (Text), ElevenLabs (Voice), Gemini (Images)
- **Deployment:** Vercel

# Coding Rules
- Use "use client" only when necessary (interaction).
- **Strictly** use the `convex` folder for backend logic.
- Do not make up external libraries. Use what is installed.
- If you don't know the Convex syntax, ask me to check documentation.

